%N A401953 Number of words of length 4*n over the alphabet [4] such that c(2) = c(3) = c(4), any prefix satisfies c(1) >= c(2), c(1) >= c(3), c(2) >= c(4), c(3) >= c(4), and (c(1) - c(4)) <= 2. Here c(i) is the number of occurrences of the letter i.
%H A401953 Paolo Xausa, <a href="/A401953/b401953.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..822</a>
%H A401953 <a href="/index/Rec#order_02">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (15,24).
%F A401953 G.f.: (6*x^2 + 13*x - 1)/(24*x^2 + 15*x - 1).
%e A401953 a(1) = 2: (1,2,3,4), (1,3,2,4).
%e A401953 The word (1,3,2,1,4,2,3,4) satisfies the required constraints so is counted under a(2) = 48.
%t A401953 LinearRecurrence[{15, 24}, {1, 2, 48}, 20] (* _Paolo Xausa_, Nov 15 2026 *)
